  "prefLabel": "Vet 604.01 Establishing a VCPR",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Vet 604.01 Establishing a VCPR. A VCPR shall be established only through an in-person physical examination by the licensed veterinarian or an in-person site visit by the licensed veterinarian.\n\nSource. #13453, eff 9-29-22",
